How to start zookeeper and kafka-broker
1. Start Start Zookeeper
> cd kafka_2.13-3.3.1/bin
> ./zookeeper-server-start.sh ../config/zookeeper.properties

2. Start Kafka Broker
> cd kafka_2.13-3.3.1/bin
> ./kafka-server-start.sh ../config/server.properties

How to send the json-wikimedia real time data from kafka-producer
1. Just start the app, it call sendMessage() to send the json-wikimedia to kafka-topic
2. consumer will read this message from kafka-topic and save into DB.